### Prueba del servicio
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/prueba


### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Victor Daniel",
  "correo": "victor@cafearoma.com",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Login correcto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "victor@cafearoma.com",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Login incorrecto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "victor@cafearoma.com",
  "password": "11111"
}